        "gg4TkwRjFpV_text": "<p>ThePhotoStick Omni Protective Case is perfect for keeping small tech essentials together, including ThePhotoStick devices, USB drives, earbuds, SD cards, charging cables, adapters, and other compact accessories.</p>",
        "ggDFVBy3_ux_text": "<p>While the case is water-resistant and can protect your drives from rain or accidental spills, it is not completely waterproof and should never be submerged underwater.</p>",
        "ggaEVrQTJHR_text": "<p>ThePhotoStick Omni Protective Case is approximately 11cm x 5cm x 3.5cm. Today's standard USB drives will fit perfectly inside the case's mesh pockets without slipping out, ensuring your data and precious memories are always kept safe.</p>",
        "ggmySa8-oE__text": "<p>We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, our team is here to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-return-and-refund-process\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Returns and Refunds</strong></a> page.</p>",
        "ggqsP5Ip4P5_background_mobile_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPS_LP_Mobile_33.png",
        "ggqsP5Ip4P5_background_tablet_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPS_LP_Mobile_33.png",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_0": "<p>Is ThePhotoStick® Omni Protective Case waterproof?</p>",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_1": "<p>What can I store in the Protective Case?</p>",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_2": "<p>What are the dimensions of ThePhotoStick® Omni Protective Case?</p>",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_3": "<p>Will every size flash drive fit inside?</p>",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_4": "<p>How does the 30-Day Money Back Guarantee work?</p>",
        "ggy8wQHDqPh_text": "<p>ThePhotoStick Omni Protective Case features two easy-access mesh pockets, allowing different-sized USB drives and other mobile accessories, such as charging cables, to fit inside with ease.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-636444779831493435"
